                <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="!mb-0 mt-0"><strong>Last updated: December 27, 2025</strong></p>
<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
<p class="!mb-0 mt-0">Welcome to Pace Flow ("we," "our," or "us"). We are committed to protecting your privacy. Pace Flow is a 100% offline application — we have no servers, no backend, and no internet connectivity whatsoever. All your data exists only on your device and never leaves it.</p>
<h2>2. Data Usage</h2>
<p class="!mb-0 mt-0">Pace Flow does not collect, transmit, or store any of your data on external servers. All information stays on your device. Here's how we use data locally:</p>
<h3>Approximate Location (Optional)</h3>
<ul>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Detect your local currency when adding transactions</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;"><strong>How it works:</strong> Used once in real-time, then immediately discarded</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;"><strong>Storage:</strong> NEVER stored, NEVER uploaded — we have no servers</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;"><strong>Network:</strong> No internet connection is made — location is processed 100% locally</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;"><strong>Control:</strong> You can enable or disable this in Settings anytime</li>
</ul>
<h3>Transaction Records</h3>
<ul>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Store your expense and income records</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;"><strong>Storage:</strong> Stored 100% locally on your device using Apple's secure frameworks</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;"><strong>Network:</strong> NEVER uploaded anywhere — we have no servers to upload to</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;"><strong>Control:</strong> Delete the app to permanently remove all data</li>
</ul>
<h2>3. Information We Do NOT Collect</h2>
<p class="!mb-0 mt-0">We want to be clear about what we do not collect:</p>
<ul>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;">No account registration or login required</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;">No email addresses or personal identifiers</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;">No credit card numbers or payment details</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;">No usage analytics or tracking</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;">No data shared with third parties</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;">No cloud sync or server uploads</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;">No internet connection required to use the app</li>
</ul>
<h2>4. In-App Purchases</h2>
<p class="!mb-0 mt-0">Pace Flow offers optional in-app purchases (subscriptions and lifetime access). All payment processing is handled entirely by Apple through the App Store. We do not have access to your payment information, credit card details, or billing address. For information about how Apple handles your payment data, please refer to Apple's Privacy Policy.</p>
<h2>5. Local Storage &amp; Security</h2>
<p class="!mb-0 mt-0">All your data is stored locally on your device using Apple's secure data storage frameworks (SwiftData). Your data is protected by your device's built-in security features, including Face ID, Touch ID, or passcode protection.</p>
<p class="!mb-0 mt-0">Because Pace Flow has no servers and makes no network connections, there is zero risk of data breaches from our side — we simply have no way to access your data.</p>
<h2>6. Data Deletion</h2>
<p class="!mb-0 mt-0">Since all data is stored locally on your device:</p>
<ul>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;">To delete all data: Simply delete the Pace Flow app from your device</li>
<li class="[&amp;&gt;p]:inline" style="--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(67, 128, 180, 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0); box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0.428571em; font-size: 0.813rem; color: #cccccc; border: 0px solid #c0c1c6;">To delete specific records: Use the app's built-in delete function</li>
</ul>
<p class="!mb-0 mt-0">We do not retain any copies of your data, so once deleted from your device, it is permanently gone.</p>
<h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
<p class="!mb-0 mt-0">Pace Flow does not collect any personal information from any users, including children. Since the app works entirely offline with no data collection, it is safe for users of all ages.</p>
<h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p class="!mb-0 mt-0">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected with an updated "Last updated" date at the top of this policy. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.</p>
<h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
<p class="!mb-0 mt-0">If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please contact us at: <span style="font-size: inherit;">scooomaker@outlook.com</span></p>
